						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Oh Noez! He&#039;s playin a MMO again! Someone pass the man a beer....<br /><br />I agree totally, have done alot of stuff with paladins, and hunters only, windors, attunement runs, etc... since hunters can heal thier pets fairly well, they can do quite a bit.<br /><br />But alot of your higher end content beyond that is pretty well designed to take the optimals, leaving few ways to accomplish them with less. <br /><br />There are more variables in WoW tho, like in MC recently, we cleared all the way through to Garr, and killed him with 3 priests, adn 2 druids. Our druids kick ass in our alliance.</td>
